sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Edge as Edge Service (gate)
    participant Ingest as Ingest API (/api/v1/parking-events)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Relay as Outbox Relay (poller)
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ (parkvision.events)
    participant Consumer as Consumer (e.g. db-projector)

    Edge->>Ingest: POST /api/v1/parking-events<br/>X-Gate-Key, eventId (UUID), occurredAt, payload
    Ingest->>DB: BEGIN TX
    Ingest->>DB: INSERT ParkingEvent (unique constraint on event_id)
    alt event_id already exists
        DB-->>Ingest: unique violation
        Ingest->>DB: ROLLBACK (no-op)
        Ingest-->>Edge: 200 OK (idempotent replay, cached result)
    else new event
        Ingest->>DB: INSERT outbox_message (same TX, status=PENDING)
        Ingest->>DB: COMMIT
        Ingest-->>Edge: 202 Accepted
    end

    loop every ~200ms, batch 100
        Relay->>DB: SELECT ... FROM outbox_message WHERE status='PENDING' FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        Relay->>MQ: basic.publish(routingKey, payload) [publisher confirms]
        MQ-->>Relay: ack
        Relay->>DB: UPDATE outbox_message SET status='DISPATCHED', dispatched_at=now()
    end

    MQ->>Consumer: deliver(message)
    Consumer->>Consumer: process (idempotent on event_id)
    Consumer-->>MQ: ack
    Note over Relay,DB: On publish failure, message stays PENDING and is retried,<br/>after N attempts it is marked FAILED and alerted on.
